 r←Test_AskString_001(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "AskForString" method with defaults parameters only. Input via "KeyPress".
⍝ See also number 8
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Please enter your name:' '(Surname, first name)'

 n←myGuiParms parms(#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForString ∆Ask)''
 0.2 ∆Process n.∆Form
 n.Input ∆KeyPress'Kai'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.Input 9995
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.FailsIf'Kai'≢n.∆result  ⍝ Just execute →⎕lc and it will work  ⍝TODO⍝ discuss with Dyalog why that failes!

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
